<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle $1.00 lower -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle $1.00 lower -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers traded slow.  Compared to last Thursday, early sales both classes 1.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs 64.00-65.50 early.  Load high dressing Choice still in first hands.    Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs</p>
<p>scarce, few 64.00-64.50.</p>
</text>
